  "theoryOfChange": "Pure Hands has a documented approach to how their programs create impact, outlined in their 'Our Approach' and 'Our Work' sections. Their 'Our Approach' page describes an integrated strategy combining emergency humanitarian response, early recovery, and long-term resilience building, designed across the humanitarian\u2013development\u2013peace nexus. It details their objectives, which include delivering timely emergency assistance, enabling recovery and development, and strengthening climate resilience and social cohesion. The organization emphasizes a 'people-centered and results-driven approach' and states that all interventions are 'informed by context analysis, needs assessments, and continuous monitoring,' adapting programs based on evolving needs and feedback to ensure 'measurable results.'",
